---
import ServiceCard from './ServiceCard.tsx';
---
<section id="services" class="bg-white px-6 pb-20 md:px-12 md:pb-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-black md:text-5xl">Our Services</h2>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-12 gap-y-12 md:mt-16 md:grid-cols-2">
      <ServiceCard title="Design Management | Tailored Living" client:visible>
        Clarity through coordination. We elevate the project into an experience of Tailored
        Living. By partnering with you to centralize the design evolution, we maintain a unified
        record of all drawings, specifications, and contracts, ensuring your project documentation
        remains aligned with the vision, from concept to completion.
      </ServiceCard>

      <ServiceCard title="Colour Selection & Upgrades" delay={0.1} client:visible>
        Protecting your vision, personalizing their home. We ensure that your standards remain
        intact while giving purchasers the curated freedom they desire. We guide them through a
        sophisticated selection process that transforms plans into high-end, personal havens - all
        while staying true to your original design intent.
      </ServiceCard>

      <ServiceCard title="Commercial & Residential Design" delay={0.2} client:visible>
        Design excellence that brings it all together. We tailor the environment to bring your
        space to life, ensuring every detail contributes to a cohesive, immersive experience. We
        define the vision, curating the atmosphere to give the space meaning.
      </ServiceCard>

      <ServiceCard title="Product Design" delay={0.3} client:visible>
        Precision meets imagination. We develop products that push boundaries through seamless
        integration of emerging technologies and artisan craftsmanship. From concept to
        production, every detail is examined with obsessive curiosity. The result: designs that
        feel inevitable only after they exist.
      </ServiceCard>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
